\q2 \w and there is so much|strong="H7235"\w* \w rubble|strong="H6083"\w*
\q1 \w that we|strong="H587"\w* \w will never|strong="H3808"\w* \w be able|strong="H3201"\w*
\q2 \w to rebuild|strong="H1129"\w* \w the wall|strong="H2346"\w*.”
\p \v 11 \w And our enemies|strong="H6862"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Before|strong="H5704"\w* \w -|strong="H834"\w* \w they know|strong="H3045"\w* \w [or]|strong="H3808"\w* \w see|strong="H7200"\w* \w [a thing]|strong="H3808"\w*, \w we will come|strong="H935"\w* \w into|strong="H413"\w* \w their midst|strong="H8432"\w*, \w kill them|strong="H2026"\w*, \w and put an end|strong="H7673"\w* \w -|strong="H853"\w* \w to the work|strong="H4399"\w*.”
\p \v 12 \w At that time|strong="H1961"\w* \w -|strong="H834"\w* \w the Jews|strong="H3064"\w* \w who lived|strong="H3427"\w* \w nearby|strong="H681"\w* \w came|strong="H935"\w* \w and told|strong="H559"\w* us \w ten|strong="H6235"\w* \w times [over]|strong="H6471"\w*, “\w Wherever|strong="H3605"\w* \w . . .|strong="H4725"\w* \w -|strong="H834"\w* \w you turn|strong="H7725"\w*, \w they will attack us|strong="H5921"\w*.”
