\p \v 13 \w On the second|strong="H8145"\w* \w day [of the month]|strong="H3117"\w*, \w the heads|strong="H7218"\w* \w of all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the families|strong="H1"\w* \w . . .|strong="H5971"\w*, \w along with the priests|strong="H3548"\w* \w and Levites|strong="H3881"\w*, \w gathered|strong="H622"\w* \w around|strong="H413"\w* \w Ezra|strong="H5830"\w* \w the scribe|strong="H5608"\w* \w to study|strong="H7919"\w* \w . . .|strong="H413"\w* \w the words|strong="H1697"\w* \w of the Law|strong="H8451"\w*. \v 14 \w And they found|strong="H4672"\w* \w written|strong="H3789"\w* \w in the Law|strong="H8451"\w*, \w which|strong="H834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had commanded|strong="H6680"\w* \w through|strong="H3027"\w* \w Moses|strong="H4872"\w*, \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H1121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H3478"\w* \w were to dwell|strong="H3427"\w* \w in booths|strong="H5521"\w*\f + \fr 8:14 \ft Or \fqa tabernacles \ft or \fqa shelters\ft ; also in verses 15, 16, and 17\f* \w during the feast|strong="H2282"\w* \w of the seventh|strong="H7637"\w* \w month|strong="H2320"\w*, \v 15 \w and that|strong="H834"\w* \w they should proclaim|strong="H8085"\w* \w this message|strong="H6963"\w* \w and spread [it]|strong="H5674"\w* \w throughout|strong="H3605"\w* \w their towns|strong="H5892"\w* \w and in Jerusalem|strong="H3389"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Go out|strong="H3318"\w* \w to the hill country|strong="H2022"\w* \w and bring back|strong="H935"\w* \w branches|strong="H5929"\w* \w of olive|strong="H2132"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H5929"\w*\w . . .|strong="H6086"\w* \w wild olive|strong="H8081"\w*,\f + \fr 8:15 \ft Or \fqa pine\ft ; literally \fqa oil tree\f* \w . . .|strong="H5929"\w* \w myrtle|strong="H1918"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H5929"\w* \w palm|strong="H8558"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H5929"\w* \w and [other] leafy|strong="H5687"\w* \w trees|strong="H6086"\w*, \w to make|strong="H6213"\w* \w booths|strong="H5521"\w*, \w as it is written|stron