\p \v 1 \w Now these|strong="H428"\w* \w are the priests|strong="H3548"\w* \w and Levites|strong="H3881"\w* \w who|strong="H834"\w* \w went up|strong="H5927"\w* \w with|strong="H5973"\w* \w Zerubbabel|strong="H2216"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Shealtiel|strong="H7597"\w* \w and with Jeshua|strong="H3442"\w*:
